WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.770 --> 01:31.150
[My Journey to You]

01:31.180 --> 01:34.050
[Episode 10]

01:34.140 --> 01:35.210
Miss Yun Weishan,

01:35.900 --> 01:37.030
what can I do for you?

01:37.920 --> 01:39.330
I want to ask you...

01:42.060 --> 01:43.740
if you lost something.

01:54.620 --> 01:56.420
How do you know I lost something?

01:57.690 --> 01:58.620
Did you steal it?

02:00.570 --> 02:01.100
Speak.

02:06.720 --> 02:07.540
Anonymous.

02:15.190 --> 02:16.120
What did you say?

02:18.130 --> 02:18.829
You have...

02:20.380 --> 02:21.110
no evidence.

02:23.360 --> 02:24.890
I said you have no evidence.

02:26.010 --> 02:27.270
Why would you say that?

02:30.820 --> 02:32.110
If you didn't steal it,

02:33.430 --> 02:34.310
how did you know

02:34.310 --> 02:35.310
I lost something.

02:36.290 --> 02:37.950
It's Jin Fan and Gong Yuanzhi.

02:43.110 --> 02:44.440
Jin Fan and Gong Yuanzhi

02:44.560 --> 02:46.620
fought from your room to the lineage.

02:46.900 --> 02:48.160
Jin Fan loudly scolded

02:48.180 --> 02:50.780
Gong Yuanzhi for stealing something from you.

02:50.820 --> 02:52.280
The servants all heard it.

02:54.350 --> 02:56.690
Although I haven't been in the Gong family for long,

02:56.690 --> 02:57.650
I can see

02:58.490 --> 03:02.020
there's been some conflict between Jue Lineage and Yu Lineage.

03:02.930 --> 03:03.580
This time,

03:04.540 --> 03:06.470
Gong Yuanzhi broke into your room,

03:06.920 --> 03:08.850
probably with no good intentions.

03:10.950 --> 03:13.480
This is an internal matter of the Gong family.

03:14.290 --> 03:15.890
It has nothing to do with you.

03:16.500 --> 03:18.560
Don't make too many guesses about it.

03:18.810 --> 03:19.670
Your Ladyship,

03:20.829 --> 03:22.560
since I entered the Yu Lineage,

03:22.720 --> 03:25.520
and will be the Sword Wielder's wife in the future,

03:25.720 --> 03:26.980
the Sword Wielder and I

03:27.440 --> 03:28.310
will share weal

03:28.890 --> 03:29.780
and woe.

03:32.340 --> 03:33.540
How does Gong Zhiyuan

03:33.730 --> 03:35.530
stealing something from my room

03:35.930 --> 03:38.329
have anything to do with the Sword Wielder?

03:40.320 --> 03:41.310
You think...

03:44.420 --> 03:45.600
quite deeply.

03:47.320 --> 03:50.450
Does it really have nothing to do with the Sword Wielder?

03:51.210 --> 03:53.010
Their fight was no child's play.

03:54.460 --> 03:55.860
Their moves were strong.

03:56.100 --> 03:57.590
Both of them were injured.

03:58.690 --> 04:00.350
Gong Yuanzhi aside,

04:01.460 --> 04:03.390
Jin Fan tried so hard to protect it,

04:03.640 --> 04:06.570
it has to have something to do with the Sword Wielder.

04:08.580 --> 04:10.070
How observant.

04:15.700 --> 04:17.029
What Gong Yuanzhi stole

04:17.779 --> 04:19.570
is indeed something

04:19.890 --> 04:22.890
that can threaten Ziyu's position as a Sword Wielder.

04:26.100 --> 04:29.150
It has something to do with the Sword Wielder's background.

04:29.150 --> 04:30.950
You also believed those rumors?

04:35.450 --> 04:36.380
For Gong Ziyu,

04:38.540 --> 04:40.800
you're willing to risk anything, right?

04:41.900 --> 04:42.370
Yes.

04:48.120 --> 04:49.240
The thing I lost

04:50.460 --> 04:52.720
was the medical record of Ziyu's mother,

04:53.000 --> 04:54.800
Lady Lan, during her pregnancy.

05:01.380 --> 05:02.510
This medical record

05:02.770 --> 05:04.370
shall be kept with me for now.

05:04.910 --> 05:06.860
I don't believe that Gong Yuanzhi

05:07.470 --> 05:09.270
will still dare to come steal it.

05:20.020 --> 05:21.550
I'm not afraid of Gong Yuanzhi.

05:21.550 --> 05:22.690
We can fight again.

05:23.610 --> 05:24.790
What I fear is...

05:25.460 --> 05:26.320
Gong Shangjue.

05:27.370 --> 05:27.940
And you.

05:35.980 --> 05:36.990
Let me keep it.

05:39.700 --> 05:41.230
What are you talking about?

05:41.570 --> 05:42.850
You don't trust me?

05:43.360 --> 05:45.350
All these years, I've been loyal to you–

05:45.350 --> 05:46.260
I'm afraid you'll be in danger.

05:46.260 --> 05:46.780
Oh?

05:53.130 --> 05:53.570
Oh?

05:54.930 --> 05:55.860
Leave it with me.

05:56.470 --> 05:57.800
Even if there's danger,

05:58.300 --> 05:59.280
let me handle it.

06:10.900 --> 06:13.610
Gosh... Gosh...

06:21.180 --> 06:22.510
Young Master Shangjue.

06:23.190 --> 06:24.270
After moving in,

06:24.830 --> 06:26.470
I've been trying to think of ways

06:26.470 --> 06:27.480
to make you happy.

06:28.400 --> 06:29.450
I did many things

06:29.620 --> 06:31.530
that you didn't like.

06:33.740 --> 06:35.190
But I really want

06:35.420 --> 06:36.490
to help you.

06:38.400 --> 06:38.990
That way,

06:39.310 --> 06:40.710
I can live up to my status.

06:43.510 --> 06:44.430
Your status?

06:46.200 --> 06:47.310
How arrogant.

06:49.620 --> 06:50.440
Just now,

06:51.240 --> 06:52.650
I heard Jin Fan

06:53.130 --> 06:55.340
snatched something from Young Master Yuanzhi.

06:55.340 --> 06:56.620
If this thing

06:56.790 --> 06:57.850
is very important,

06:58.360 --> 07:00.290
he will definitely carry it on him.

07:00.340 --> 07:02.800
Jin Fan will be wary of Young Master Yuanzhi,

07:03.260 --> 07:04.730
but not me.

07:06.200 --> 07:07.130
If you fail,

07:09.250 --> 07:11.500
the consequences won't be as simple as you think.

07:11.500 --> 07:12.430
I'll do anything

07:13.110 --> 07:13.950
for you.

07:16.710 --> 07:17.640
You care so much?

07:18.620 --> 07:19.900
The fate of one's husband

07:19.900 --> 07:21.580
is more important than heaven.

07:21.580 --> 07:22.310
No?

07:24.080 --> 07:25.010
Good tea.

07:28.870 --> 07:30.470
The thing you're going to get

07:31.100 --> 07:32.500
is half a medical record.

07:34.159 --> 07:35.820
As to its content and purpose,

07:36.810 --> 07:38.670
don't ask what you shouldn't ask,

07:38.980 --> 07:40.909
and don't read what you shouldn't.

07:42.040 --> 07:42.770
Understand?

07:44.980 --> 07:45.530
Yes.

07:49.460 --> 07:50.800
You seem worried.

07:52.320 --> 07:54.320
I'm worried that he's acting tough.

07:55.430 --> 07:56.560
He's afraid of cold.

07:57.210 --> 07:59.540
He has been spoiled since he was young too.

07:59.990 --> 08:01.390
He can't bear hardships.

08:02.840 --> 08:03.560
Perhaps,

08:03.980 --> 08:05.430
just a small dip into the water

08:05.430 --> 08:07.860
will get him resurfacing while screaming.

08:09.820 --> 08:11.080
With his personality,

08:11.900 --> 08:13.810
he can't stand this test.

08:16.350 --> 08:17.030
Really?

08:18.960 --> 08:21.090
My thoughts are the opposite of yours.

08:22.470 --> 08:23.050
Maybe,

08:24.340 --> 08:25.340
he was indeed

08:25.340 --> 08:27.030
a playboy who loafed around.

08:30.530 --> 08:31.210
But now,

08:33.350 --> 08:35.610
he is persistent about many more things.

08:36.330 --> 08:38.059
Persistence alone is useless.

08:38.500 --> 08:39.700
You have to be capable

08:40.120 --> 08:41.270
to be recognized.

08:42.760 --> 08:44.420
Persistence and capability.

08:45.090 --> 08:46.190
What we want to test

08:46.290 --> 08:47.550
is one of these two, no?

08:50.680 --> 08:51.960
I hope his persistence

08:55.010 --> 08:56.870
is better than his capabilities.

08:58.810 --> 08:59.940
Are you referring to

09:00.180 --> 09:01.080
two people?

09:04.440 --> 09:06.100
That Gong Ziyu's persistence

09:07.160 --> 09:09.690
can overtake Gong Shangjue's capabilities.

09:49.780 --> 09:50.790
So delicate.

09:51.260 --> 09:53.230
You don't deserve to be my son.

09:53.500 --> 09:55.180
Gong Ziyu doesn't deserve to be the Sword Wielder.

09:55.180 --> 09:56.240
In terms of status,

09:56.300 --> 09:57.140
capabilities,

09:57.140 --> 09:57.800
and virtue,

09:58.020 --> 09:59.020
you have nothing.

09:59.410 --> 10:00.440
How can you say

10:00.810 --> 10:02.470
you can take on this position?

10:21.930 --> 10:23.660
Our parents forced us to grow up

10:23.780 --> 10:25.100
because maybe they just hoped that

10:25.100 --> 10:27.140
we can survive in this world safely.

10:27.940 --> 10:29.680
I'll teach you the moves verbally first.

10:29.680 --> 10:31.130
Can you memorize it first?

10:31.130 --> 10:31.740
Okay!

10:31.740 --> 10:32.390
Very well.

10:33.570 --> 10:35.500
Cold air enters the clouds.

10:35.540 --> 10:37.660
Cold air enters the clouds.

10:37.810 --> 10:40.230
The reception and delivery must be controlled

10:40.230 --> 10:42.290
The reception and delivery must be controlled

10:42.290 --> 10:45.590
-Gather in the core.
-Gather in the core.

10:46.010 --> 10:48.230
Snow falls, but the heart does not.

10:50.780 --> 10:52.640
I hope he won't be too persistent.

10:53.190 --> 10:55.380
His perseverance to not give up

10:57.020 --> 10:58.910
will make him persist in diving downwards

10:58.910 --> 11:00.510
until the diversion stream.

11:00.900 --> 11:04.330
Under the diversion will be cold water no more.

11:05.150 --> 11:07.280
It might even be warm and comfortable.

11:08.300 --> 11:08.950
But

11:09.470 --> 11:11.530
he doesn't have strong internal skill

11:11.530 --> 11:13.930
to help control his breathing accurately.

11:14.390 --> 11:16.050
The remaining air in his lungs

11:16.680 --> 11:19.140
is only enough for him to float immediately.

11:19.640 --> 11:21.130
If he persists to

11:21.130 --> 11:23.590
continue to dive to the bottom of the pool...

11:25.630 --> 11:26.760
How would he choose?

11:28.070 --> 11:29.220
That's why I said

11:31.720 --> 11:33.580
I hope he won't be too persistent.

11:46.280 --> 11:47.100
The water...

11:47.750 --> 11:48.810
has become warmer.

11:51.910 --> 11:53.530
Should I go up to the surface to ensure my life

11:53.530 --> 11:54.660
or finish the trial?

11:57.100 --> 11:57.960
Sword Wielder,

11:58.300 --> 11:58.900
remember,

11:59.940 --> 12:01.140
don't push yourself.

15:39.390 --> 15:40.190
You're awake.

15:43.420 --> 15:43.820
Here.

15:48.190 --> 15:49.050
It's so warm.

15:51.300 --> 15:52.330
This is the clothes you prepared

15:52.330 --> 15:53.660
for me from the luggage.

15:53.860 --> 15:55.190
I just heated it up.

16:00.080 --> 16:00.990
I'm curious.

16:01.300 --> 16:03.430
How did you break through the Ice Pool?

18:05.200 --> 18:09.420
♫The hills become sand with the wind♫

18:12.590 --> 18:16.790
♫The river takes me home♫

18:22.030 --> 18:25.030
♫The cloud in the sky doesn't speak♫

18:25.580 --> 18:28.940
♫Where are you, where are you?♫

18:29.130 --> 18:31.780
♫How are you?♫

18:34.020 --> 18:38.860
♫When the clouds cry, it becomes sunset♫

18:41.130 --> 18:44.990
♫Look at the sky, flowers bloom♫

18:50.540 --> 18:53.630
♫Can the clouds and soil meet?♫

18:54.170 --> 18:56.710
♫Every wave♫

18:57.240 --> 19:00.410
♫Is asking about him♫

19:00.790 --> 19:07.490
♫The ground will nurture♫

19:07.950 --> 19:11.060
♫And a pair of wings will grow♫

19:11.080 --> 19:14.590
♫Take me to fly♫

19:15.040 --> 19:19.050
♫The clouds and soil are different♫

19:19.570 --> 19:22.370
♫You always tell me that♫

19:22.640 --> 19:25.040
♫But in my heart♫

19:25.830 --> 19:28.860
♫There's a little light♫

19:45.370 --> 19:46.900
It's none of your business.

19:49.050 --> 19:50.510
No matter how they passed,

19:50.710 --> 19:52.050
it's their ability.

20:22.520 --> 20:26.180
Are all the secret scriptures at the Xue Lineage all transparent?

20:26.240 --> 20:27.540
I almost died

20:27.540 --> 20:29.070
and you're still lying to me.

20:29.070 --> 20:29.850
Not almost.

20:30.960 --> 20:32.690
If Yun Weishan didn't save you,

20:33.040 --> 20:34.170
you would have died.

20:40.040 --> 20:41.110
So you knew

20:42.100 --> 20:44.630
I only succeeded because we worked together?

20:50.340 --> 20:51.950
Aren't you very strict?

20:53.440 --> 20:55.970
Why are you not abiding by the rules suddenly?

20:57.290 --> 20:58.490
I abided by the rules.

20:59.830 --> 21:00.830
During the trial,

21:01.180 --> 21:03.000
it is not allowed for any outsider to

21:03.000 --> 21:03.660
intervene.

21:04.870 --> 21:07.040
But you did reach the bottom of the water

21:07.040 --> 21:08.050
and got the box.

21:09.920 --> 21:11.250
According to the rules,

21:11.890 --> 21:13.380
as long as you can get the box successfully,

21:13.380 --> 21:14.980
it will be considered a pass.

21:16.510 --> 21:18.240
After you entered the Ice Pool,

21:18.700 --> 21:20.030
he has been by your side,

21:20.700 --> 21:22.300
ready to save you at any time.

21:24.290 --> 21:24.850
Wait.

21:26.750 --> 21:27.650
I passed...

21:28.490 --> 21:29.120
the trial?

21:30.950 --> 21:32.270
You mean

21:32.270 --> 21:33.330
I passed the trial?

21:41.330 --> 21:44.060
The Thousand-Year Ice Lotus Pool's biting cold,

21:44.140 --> 21:46.450
apart from being able to make the trial taker experience devastation

21:46.450 --> 21:48.810
and consume their internal skill rapidly,

21:48.810 --> 21:51.610
it will also bewitch people's mind due to the cold.

21:52.380 --> 21:53.620
If the person who dived in

21:53.620 --> 21:54.620
is weak mentally,

21:55.130 --> 21:57.260
they will definitely give up halfway.

21:57.860 --> 21:59.260
Only the mentally strong

21:59.860 --> 22:01.120
can stick to their wish

22:01.430 --> 22:03.290
and dive to the bottom of the pool.

22:04.630 --> 22:05.760
Under the cold pool,

22:06.100 --> 22:07.300
are secret ley lines.

22:07.820 --> 22:09.880
So the lower half of the water is warm.

22:10.590 --> 22:12.650
As long as a trial taker is determined

22:12.990 --> 22:14.900
to survive the first half of the biting cold,

22:14.900 --> 22:15.960
they will succeed.

22:17.630 --> 22:19.020
Those who waver easily

22:20.260 --> 22:23.120
will return to the water surface in the middle of it.

22:23.510 --> 22:24.170
This trial

22:24.710 --> 22:26.180
is a test of the trial taker's

22:26.180 --> 22:27.780
persistence or capability.

22:28.370 --> 22:29.710
Either one of them

22:30.340 --> 22:32.000
can help them pass this trial.

22:34.150 --> 22:37.650
There is no so-called secret scripture at the bottom of the pool.

22:37.650 --> 22:40.510
The secret scripture is to break through yourself.

22:41.960 --> 22:42.630
You...

22:43.830 --> 22:44.960
Don't mention about

22:46.230 --> 22:47.430
how I saved your life.

22:48.030 --> 22:49.080
I mean...

22:49.900 --> 22:50.870
your porridge

22:52.070 --> 22:52.600
is burnt.

22:58.790 --> 22:59.720
It's delicious.

23:01.020 --> 23:01.370
Hey!

23:01.710 --> 23:03.370
Miss Yun prepared that for me.

23:03.830 --> 23:04.440
It's fine.

23:06.900 --> 23:07.640
How stingy.

23:24.040 --> 23:26.500
Miss Yun needs to go back to the front hill tomorrow.

23:26.500 --> 23:27.910
Because there are some things

23:27.910 --> 23:30.510
I have to relay to the Sword Wielder privately.

23:32.320 --> 23:32.950
All right.

23:40.960 --> 23:43.420
[Shang]

23:53.500 --> 23:53.860
Gosh.

23:53.860 --> 23:54.470
Ouch!

23:54.530 --> 23:54.910
Ouch!

23:56.650 --> 23:57.240
Gosh.

23:57.430 --> 23:58.020
-Hurry.
-Young Master.

23:58.020 --> 23:58.330
Help him.

23:58.330 --> 23:59.380
-Help him.
-What are you doing here?

23:59.380 --> 24:00.920
Gosh. Get up.

24:01.060 --> 24:01.740
It's dirty.

24:01.760 --> 24:02.490
Are you okay?

24:02.830 --> 24:04.400
Thief! Give it back to me.

24:04.740 --> 24:05.980
How could you say that?

24:05.980 --> 24:07.540
You hit me first.

24:07.740 --> 24:08.630
Even if you're not a thief,

24:08.630 --> 24:09.700
you are blind.

24:09.820 --> 24:11.080
Watch where you're going.

24:11.080 --> 24:11.480
Hey.

24:12.110 --> 24:13.350
I'm your sister.

24:13.350 --> 24:14.850
You can't be rude to me.

24:14.910 --> 24:16.460
You're not my sister.

24:16.860 --> 24:18.320
Mother hates you the most.

24:20.220 --> 24:21.190
That's because

24:21.360 --> 24:23.270
your mother is not my mother.

24:23.650 --> 24:25.830
But your father is my father.

24:25.960 --> 24:27.510
So we are still siblings.

24:27.540 --> 24:29.640
But my father said he doesn't like you too.

24:29.640 --> 24:30.750
He only likes me.

24:36.610 --> 24:37.430
Let’s go first.

24:37.430 --> 24:39.230
What kind of Lineage Head is she?

24:39.930 --> 24:42.260
I am the Lineage Head of the Shang Lineage.

24:42.900 --> 24:44.220
When I grow up,

24:44.220 --> 24:46.320
Father will make her return the position to me.

24:46.320 --> 24:46.720
Humph.

24:47.690 --> 24:48.380
Ah.

24:49.550 --> 24:50.790
Don't cry.

24:51.000 --> 24:51.780
Let's get up.

24:51.840 --> 24:53.370
I'll take you to the clinic.

24:59.580 --> 25:00.800
Are you satisfied?

25:01.220 --> 25:01.990
About what?

25:02.370 --> 25:04.430
I made him kneel and apologize to you.

25:05.060 --> 25:06.620
So it's you!

25:07.450 --> 25:09.490
You're the best, Xiaohei.

25:09.770 --> 25:10.500
Of course.

25:10.710 --> 25:11.780
I think about

25:11.780 --> 25:13.190
serving you everyday.

25:15.080 --> 25:15.670
But...

25:15.980 --> 25:17.980
You've already forgotten about me recently.

25:17.980 --> 25:20.020
You don't even come look for me to do research.

25:20.020 --> 25:20.590
Sigh.

25:20.590 --> 25:22.850
All you do is chase after that man all day.

25:23.670 --> 25:25.130
His name is Jin Fan, right?

25:25.230 --> 25:25.670
Humph.

25:25.900 --> 25:26.960
I'll remember him.

25:27.220 --> 25:28.260
As you can see,

25:28.820 --> 25:30.020
although I am

25:30.020 --> 25:31.910
in charge of everything in the Shang Lineage,

25:31.910 --> 25:33.670
no one takes me seriously.

25:34.520 --> 25:35.100
See,

25:35.460 --> 25:37.460
no matter how good

25:37.460 --> 25:38.990
or powerful the weapon I create is,

25:38.990 --> 25:40.780
my father won't even take another look.

25:40.780 --> 25:41.760
What's the use?

25:43.230 --> 25:45.030
It's better to be good to Jin Fan.

25:45.340 --> 25:46.600
At least

25:46.830 --> 25:48.090
he really loves me.

25:48.930 --> 25:50.020
I don't see it.

25:50.440 --> 25:51.320
I only see you

25:51.340 --> 25:53.380
chasing after him all day long.

25:54.660 --> 25:55.930
What do you know?

25:57.230 --> 25:57.840
Gosh.

26:10.800 --> 26:11.830
Eldest Young Miss.

26:11.830 --> 26:12.670
Young Master Ziyu said

26:12.670 --> 26:13.990
this is the hill pear from this year.

26:13.990 --> 26:15.190
He knows you like them

26:15.380 --> 26:17.110
so he asked me to bring you some.

26:19.020 --> 26:20.080
Eldest Young Miss?

26:28.470 --> 26:29.530
Eldest Young Miss.

26:37.170 --> 26:38.630
You have such a high fever.

26:38.810 --> 26:40.540
Why is no one taking care of you?

26:41.850 --> 26:43.250
Where are your servants?

26:45.630 --> 26:47.160
I'll take you to the clinic.

27:28.680 --> 27:29.670
To be honest,

27:30.260 --> 27:31.620
I've recovered.

27:32.020 --> 27:32.740
Say no more,

27:32.910 --> 27:33.970
take the medicine.

27:34.330 --> 27:35.460
I can't do as you say.

27:35.930 --> 27:36.930
It's not up to you.

27:37.260 --> 27:38.980
My life is horrible. No!

27:45.810 --> 27:46.740
Wait for me then.

27:54.840 --> 27:56.640
Just wait for me for a while here.

28:24.530 --> 28:26.530
Do you want your favorite hill pear?

28:26.670 --> 28:27.660
Then take the medicine too

28:27.660 --> 28:28.460
along with it.

28:38.350 --> 28:39.820
It's bitter but sweet.

28:40.620 --> 28:42.050
Sweet but bitter.

28:42.870 --> 28:43.650
Is this

28:44.300 --> 28:45.390
the sweet and bitter

28:45.390 --> 28:46.670
taste of love

28:47.300 --> 28:48.770
they talk about

28:49.510 --> 28:51.040
in romance novels?

28:58.540 --> 28:59.110
Goodbye.

29:11.210 --> 29:11.670
Good...

29:12.390 --> 29:13.060
Goodbye.

29:47.580 --> 29:48.710
You're still young.

29:49.140 --> 29:50.540
How do I tell you about it?

29:50.670 --> 29:52.310
The relationship between men and women

29:52.310 --> 29:53.780
can't be explained

29:53.970 --> 29:55.160
in just a few words.

29:55.580 --> 29:56.590
You're talking nonsense again.

29:56.590 --> 29:57.650
I'm older than you.

29:57.900 --> 29:59.980
Your face may be bigger, but everything else is below me.

29:59.980 --> 30:02.120
You're a servant in the kitchen.

30:02.350 --> 30:03.610
If people find out that

30:03.780 --> 30:05.140
you came here to look for me secretly,

30:05.140 --> 30:06.820
you'll be doomed.

30:06.850 --> 30:08.320
You didn't come looking for me

30:08.320 --> 30:09.890
so I can only come look for you.

30:09.890 --> 30:10.820
You have no idea.

30:11.150 --> 30:12.900
So many terrible and scary things

30:12.900 --> 30:14.300
happened in the Gong family.

30:14.300 --> 30:15.900
How can I tell you about them?

30:16.070 --> 30:17.180
I am shocked,

30:17.390 --> 30:18.360
worried,

30:18.510 --> 30:19.910
and scared.

30:20.550 --> 30:21.880
Tell me about it slowly.

30:22.460 --> 30:23.790
I'll help you calm down.

30:24.050 --> 30:24.650
All right.

30:25.310 --> 30:27.310
Let me stretch while I talk about it.

30:27.670 --> 30:29.240
Here's what happened.

30:55.110 --> 30:55.990
What's wrong?

30:56.930 --> 30:58.660
You look pale.

31:01.010 --> 31:02.870
I just came back from the back hill

31:03.090 --> 31:04.520
and I caught a cold.

31:05.250 --> 31:06.470
What a good time to

31:08.070 --> 31:09.350
catch a cold.

31:09.770 --> 31:11.300
I wish I can catch a cold too.

31:12.100 --> 31:14.230
My internal organs are all burning up.

31:18.990 --> 31:20.950
This painting is so vivid.

31:22.020 --> 31:23.680
If you have the time to do this,

31:23.970 --> 31:26.450
why not spend it on drawing more maps of the Gong residence

31:26.450 --> 31:28.380
and the distribution of the posts?

31:30.950 --> 31:32.480
It's none of your business.

31:37.990 --> 31:38.830
Speaking of,

31:38.930 --> 31:40.820
Gong Ziyu cares so much about you.

31:41.260 --> 31:42.840
You and Jin Fan

31:43.110 --> 31:45.040
should be pretty close too, right?

31:45.300 --> 31:47.030
That has nothing to do with you.

31:54.460 --> 31:55.430
I didn't use to.

31:56.220 --> 31:57.090
But now it does.

31:58.830 --> 32:00.780
I need you to get close to Jin Fan

32:01.460 --> 32:03.060
and take something from him.

32:04.350 --> 32:05.410
I'm unable to help.

32:05.850 --> 32:07.150
Go get it yourself.

32:11.390 --> 32:12.650
Are you unable to help,

32:13.220 --> 32:14.880
or that you don't want to help?

32:15.380 --> 32:16.180
I'm unable,

32:17.170 --> 32:18.200
nor do I want to.

32:19.630 --> 32:20.550
You still

32:21.420 --> 32:23.020
owe me a favor from last time.

32:23.810 --> 32:24.420
What now?

32:25.030 --> 32:26.630
You don't want to pay me back?

32:28.620 --> 32:29.500
I can repay you,

32:30.470 --> 32:32.400
but you're trying to get me killed.

32:33.500 --> 32:35.660
You want me to steal something from Jin Fan.

32:35.660 --> 32:38.260
If it turns out badly, I might even lose my life.

32:39.590 --> 32:42.390
Didn't you just deliver medicine to Gong Yuanzhi?

32:42.610 --> 32:44.270
Then you must know how skilled

32:44.970 --> 32:46.400
Jin Fan is at fighting.

32:47.300 --> 32:48.030
I know.

32:49.550 --> 32:51.900
So Jin Fan is definitely not so simple.

32:52.450 --> 32:53.670
He's too strong

32:54.290 --> 32:55.220
to be

32:55.390 --> 32:56.920
just a Green Jade Guardian.

32:57.740 --> 32:59.070
I've fought him before.

32:59.820 --> 33:00.850
Although I won,

33:02.150 --> 33:03.770
but when he fought me,

33:04.270 --> 33:06.200
he didn't even use 30% of his power.

33:06.420 --> 33:07.850
Since he let you win,

33:08.790 --> 33:10.240
isn't it more convenient for you

33:10.240 --> 33:11.420
to steal it?

33:12.110 --> 33:13.060
Shangguan Qian.

33:14.650 --> 33:17.050
Do you think I don’t know what you want?

33:22.300 --> 33:23.350
You are

33:23.900 --> 33:25.390
quite well-informed.

33:26.170 --> 33:28.770
You want that half of Jin Fan's medical record.

33:29.910 --> 33:30.920
The thing I lost

33:32.260 --> 33:34.520
was the medical record of Ziyu's mother,

33:34.720 --> 33:36.520
Lady Lan, during her pregnancy.

33:39.590 --> 33:41.720
If I help you steal the medical record,

33:42.110 --> 33:43.790
I'm helping Gong Shangjue

33:43.820 --> 33:47.450
drag Gong Ziyu down from the position of his position as the Sword Wielder.

33:47.450 --> 33:49.050
My mission at the Gong family

33:49.380 --> 33:50.900
will then fail.

33:52.870 --> 33:54.090
I understand now.

33:54.620 --> 33:57.220
Gong Ziyu's background has always been a mystery.

33:57.220 --> 33:58.350
This medical record

33:58.380 --> 34:01.780
can prove that Gong Ziyu is not Gong Hongyu's biological son.

34:02.680 --> 34:03.420
Indeed...

34:04.430 --> 34:07.120
This concerns Gong Ziyu's position as the Sword Wielder.

34:07.120 --> 34:08.449
The thing you need to get

34:09.409 --> 34:10.810
is half a medical record.

34:11.550 --> 34:13.210
As to its content and purpose,

34:13.900 --> 34:15.730
don't ask what you shouldn't ask,

34:15.730 --> 34:17.790
and don't look at what you shouldn't.

34:18.310 --> 34:21.040
I didn't know the content of this medical record.

34:22.070 --> 34:24.130
Thank you for answering my question.

34:25.560 --> 34:26.360
Looks like

34:27.010 --> 34:28.810
all the more I need to get it then.

34:30.389 --> 34:31.050
Stop there.

34:35.610 --> 34:36.780
If you get it,

34:37.770 --> 34:38.860
then I'll lose.

34:44.030 --> 34:45.080
My mission

34:45.580 --> 34:47.440
has a higher priority than yours.

34:48.060 --> 34:49.520
You're but a Chi assassin.

34:49.889 --> 34:51.130
Just lose.

34:51.780 --> 34:53.710
There's no difference in priority

34:53.760 --> 34:54.980
in Wufeng missions.

35:09.050 --> 35:10.710
The same level as me?

35:11.740 --> 35:13.270
No difference in priority?

35:13.700 --> 35:15.880
Chi are pawns to start with.

35:16.090 --> 35:17.250
You'd be lucky

35:18.250 --> 35:19.810
to be able to help me.

35:31.300 --> 35:32.160
Sister Yun.

35:34.410 --> 35:36.180
If you help me succeed,

35:37.750 --> 35:39.660
and I help Gong Shangjue succeed

35:40.900 --> 35:42.370
and gain his trust,

35:46.300 --> 35:48.230
I'll be one step closer to success.

35:49.270 --> 35:50.900
After I succeed

35:51.870 --> 35:53.890
and return to Wufeng to receive the reward,

35:53.890 --> 35:55.800
I'll put in a good word for you.

35:59.310 --> 36:00.930
If you don't help me today,

36:01.750 --> 36:03.680
don't blame me for being ruthless.

36:23.030 --> 36:24.310
You're making cakes?

36:24.650 --> 36:25.170
Yes.

36:25.950 --> 36:27.480
Bitter gourd and mulberry?

36:27.500 --> 36:28.980
What kind of combination is this?

36:28.980 --> 36:30.840
Don't get a tummy upset from this.

36:31.030 --> 36:32.060
It's a delicacy from my hometown.

36:32.060 --> 36:33.990
For everyone to try something new.

36:39.140 --> 36:39.710
Miss Yun.

36:40.740 --> 36:42.230
Where is the food you left for Guardian Jin?

36:42.230 --> 36:43.070
He just came back.

36:43.070 --> 36:44.460
I have to deliver it to him.

36:44.460 --> 36:45.280
It's here.

36:48.740 --> 36:49.230
Wait.

36:54.960 --> 36:56.830
Guardian Jin has been working hard lately.

36:56.830 --> 36:58.640
Bring him some cakes.

37:00.130 --> 37:00.470
Yes.

37:12.590 --> 37:13.640
Jin Fan was fine.

37:13.700 --> 37:15.550
Why is he suddenly vomiting and having diarrheas?

37:15.550 --> 37:16.200
Right.

37:16.420 --> 37:17.750
I also found it strange.

37:18.070 --> 37:20.240
Could he have been poisoned

37:20.430 --> 37:21.980
without knowing when he fought with Young Master Yuanzhi?

37:21.980 --> 37:22.970
I'm so mad.

37:23.180 --> 37:24.730
If anything happens to Jinfan,

37:24.730 --> 37:26.260
I'll go and blow up... Gosh.

37:26.330 --> 37:28.060
I'll go and blow up Zhi Lineage.

37:29.150 --> 37:31.120
Do not be anxious, Eldest Young Miss.

37:31.120 --> 37:32.400
I am so anxious.

37:32.550 --> 37:33.470
But it doesn't matter.

37:33.470 --> 37:34.860
I brought my own Herb Elixir.

37:34.860 --> 37:36.190
Jin Fan can use it later.

37:39.460 --> 37:40.220
Jin Fan!

37:43.660 --> 37:44.380
Are you all right

37:44.380 --> 37:46.100
after being bitten by that poisonous insect?

37:46.100 --> 37:47.280
What are you doing?

37:47.340 --> 37:47.930
Ouch!

37:50.090 --> 37:51.690
You have an ulterior motive.

37:51.730 --> 37:52.660
I'm really fine.

37:52.800 --> 37:53.640
Nonsense.

37:54.040 --> 37:55.200
How can you be fine?

37:55.300 --> 37:56.060
You vomited.

37:56.290 --> 37:57.260
I've known you for so long,

37:57.260 --> 37:59.610
you haven't even sneezed before.

38:02.830 --> 38:04.680
You are the one who got bitten by

38:04.930 --> 38:06.460
Gong Yuanzhi's poisonous insects.

38:06.460 --> 38:08.440
I have to check if you are okay.

38:09.020 --> 38:10.750
That despicable Gong Yuanzhi

38:10.910 --> 38:12.220
is full of schemes.

38:12.550 --> 38:14.110
I'm afraid you won't even feel anything

38:14.110 --> 38:16.170
when you have been eaten whole by him!

38:17.640 --> 38:18.700
Eldest Young Miss,

38:18.820 --> 38:20.420
please examine him closely.

38:20.790 --> 38:22.180
I'll guard outside.

38:23.270 --> 38:23.880
Okay.

38:24.150 --> 38:24.950
Go now.

38:25.030 --> 38:25.730
Go ahead.

38:29.820 --> 38:31.860
What are you doing?

39:07.750 --> 39:09.010
I've seen everything.

39:09.340 --> 39:11.150
He is flawless indeed.

39:11.470 --> 39:12.890
There's no wound at all.

39:13.710 --> 39:14.360
Jin Fan,

39:15.100 --> 39:16.760
your skin is well maintained.

39:16.950 --> 39:18.010
Teach me your ways.

39:19.130 --> 39:20.100
Teach me.

39:20.770 --> 39:21.770
I was born with it.

39:23.670 --> 39:24.430
You're being all pretentious

39:24.430 --> 39:26.420
telling me to come out just because

39:26.530 --> 39:28.260
you're changing your clothes.

39:28.380 --> 39:30.160
Don't you run around the guardian camp

39:30.160 --> 39:32.180
without clothes on all the time?

39:36.340 --> 39:36.830
Oh no!

39:38.970 --> 39:40.190
The medical record is missing.

39:40.190 --> 39:40.630
What?

39:42.540 --> 39:43.140
By the way,

39:43.400 --> 39:44.910
I didn't tell anyone that

39:45.140 --> 39:46.620
I fought with Gong Yuanzhi.

39:46.620 --> 39:48.880
How do you know I was hurt by Gong Yuanzhi?

39:49.620 --> 39:50.670
Miss Yun said

39:50.820 --> 39:52.880
she saw a poisonous insect biting you

39:52.900 --> 39:54.470
and you vomited and had diarrheas.

39:54.470 --> 39:55.130
So I guessed

39:55.290 --> 39:56.820
you must've been poisoned.

39:56.890 --> 39:57.920
Miss Yun?

40:00.610 --> 40:02.470
Didn't she come with you just now?

40:03.170 --> 40:03.570
Yes.

40:04.140 --> 40:05.540
She's guarding the door.

40:06.990 --> 40:07.630
Miss Yun.

40:08.320 --> 40:08.930
Miss Yun?

40:19.750 --> 40:21.740
If you don't have any other instructions,

40:21.740 --> 40:22.980
I’ll leave now.

40:26.810 --> 40:27.310
Wait.

40:29.390 --> 40:30.650
Do you know how to play?

40:33.510 --> 40:34.370
I know a little.

40:36.220 --> 40:36.600
Come.

40:53.970 --> 40:54.830
Tell me.

40:56.300 --> 40:57.670
How did you get it?

41:02.610 --> 41:03.540
Through wisdom.

41:04.310 --> 41:05.710
Just like playing chess.

41:07.940 --> 41:09.600
You can't rely on brute force.

41:11.450 --> 41:12.650
But as for brute force,

41:12.650 --> 41:13.980
you're not weak either.

41:14.790 --> 41:16.790
Yuanzhi had fought with you before.

41:17.150 --> 41:18.350
He said you were good.

41:18.930 --> 41:20.950
Young Master Yuanzhi went easy on me.

41:20.950 --> 41:22.500
He used insects to scare me.

41:22.820 --> 41:24.280
He was just pulling my leg.

41:26.850 --> 41:27.840
Tell me then,

41:28.910 --> 41:30.770
how did you get it through wisdom?

41:31.430 --> 41:33.360
I can’t approach someone as tricky

41:33.530 --> 41:35.090
as Jin Fan.

41:35.970 --> 41:37.300
Then I can only leave it to

41:37.300 --> 41:39.100
someone who can get close to him.

41:43.220 --> 41:44.020
Gong Zishang?

41:44.960 --> 41:45.690
Yun Weishan.

41:48.160 --> 41:49.840
Yun Weishan and Jin Fan

41:50.590 --> 41:51.810
are so close?

41:55.010 --> 41:56.310
Not that close,

41:56.940 --> 41:58.300
but close enough to get

41:58.750 --> 41:59.880
the medical record.

42:00.780 --> 42:02.180
When did you become close

42:02.990 --> 42:04.690
with Yun Weishan then?

42:07.260 --> 42:09.210
You don't need to be close to someone

42:09.210 --> 42:10.410
to get help from them.

42:12.090 --> 42:13.390
It's enough to just know

42:13.390 --> 42:15.320
the secrets they don't want others

42:15.320 --> 42:16.120
to know about.

42:17.320 --> 42:18.320
Please excuse me.

42:20.850 --> 42:22.130
I told Yun Weishan that

42:22.610 --> 42:23.920
if she doesn't help me,

42:24.340 --> 42:25.970
I will tell Gong Ziyu about

42:26.270 --> 42:27.870
how a guardian

42:28.290 --> 42:29.350
saw her undressed.

42:30.540 --> 42:32.800
If I say a few more words to the narrative,

42:33.350 --> 42:36.410
it'll be hard for Yun Weishan to explain the situation.

42:36.500 --> 42:38.230
This concerns her reputation.

42:39.280 --> 42:42.010
If she still wants to be the Sword Wielder's wife,

42:42.190 --> 42:43.320
she can only help me.

42:46.190 --> 42:47.800
If Yun Weishan is aware that

42:48.460 --> 42:50.590
if she took the medical record for you,

42:51.170 --> 42:53.980
not to mention her status as the Sword Wielder's wife,

42:53.980 --> 42:57.640
even Gong Ziyu's position as the Sword Wielder will be taken away,

42:57.890 --> 42:59.750
she'll probably be so regretful.

43:06.190 --> 43:07.180
Is this

43:08.290 --> 43:10.820
related to the position of the Sword Wielder?

43:13.900 --> 43:16.030
You succeeded in helping me with this.

43:16.800 --> 43:18.130
What reward do you want?

43:20.260 --> 43:20.860
I dare not.

43:23.350 --> 43:24.720
It's my honor

43:25.350 --> 43:26.400
to help you.

43:27.660 --> 43:28.460
Besides,

43:29.340 --> 43:31.200
I'm just making up for my mistake.

43:31.250 --> 43:31.910
That's all.

43:39.070 --> 43:40.530
What mistake did you make?

43:44.970 --> 43:45.900
Previously,

43:48.540 --> 43:49.870
when I tried to be smart.

43:51.460 --> 43:53.190
You weren't trying to be smart.

43:54.340 --> 43:55.620
You are smart.

43:57.220 --> 43:58.210
But sometimes,

43:59.220 --> 44:02.020
a wise man can be ruined by their own intelligence.

44:07.220 --> 44:08.590
Don't get carried away.

44:12.290 --> 44:12.750
Yes.

44:26.970 --> 44:27.980
Thank you.

45:00.780 --> 45:01.740
Yun Weishan.

45:02.370 --> 45:04.170
Did you give this box of desserts

45:05.590 --> 45:07.690
to Jin Fan?

45:09.260 --> 45:09.810
Yes.

45:10.420 --> 45:11.220
What's wrong?

45:11.240 --> 45:12.250
What's wrong?

45:12.630 --> 45:14.960
You're a lady. How can you be so shameless?

45:15.720 --> 45:19.330
How can you make desserts secretly and send them to Jin Fan?

45:19.390 --> 45:20.780
He is an unmarried man.

45:20.780 --> 45:22.400
Can you avoid arousing suspicion? Even I have–

45:22.400 --> 45:23.170
That's not the point.

45:23.170 --> 45:24.750
That's the point.

45:25.690 --> 45:26.640
I'm so mad.

45:31.490 --> 45:32.900
Mulberry and bitter gourd.

45:32.900 --> 45:34.230
They are both yin foods.

45:34.770 --> 45:36.630
Miss Yun knows medicine well too.

45:36.660 --> 45:39.660
Why would you use these two ingredients as stuffings?

45:42.210 --> 45:43.970
We've gone to the kitchen

45:44.140 --> 45:46.000
to ask the grannies and servants.

45:46.180 --> 45:47.190
They all said

45:47.500 --> 45:48.810
you made the desserts

45:48.850 --> 45:50.610
and put them in Jin Fan's lunch box.

45:50.610 --> 45:52.960
Stop denying it.

46:14.940 --> 46:16.830
This is the sweet cakes from my hometown.

46:16.830 --> 46:18.960
I've been eating it since I was a child.

46:19.230 --> 46:20.490
I've made some for the Sword Wielder

46:20.490 --> 46:22.750
to bring to the back hill previously too.

46:22.860 --> 46:24.210
He wasn't unwell.

46:26.120 --> 46:27.630
I heard that Guardian Jin was injured

46:27.630 --> 46:28.790
and has a bad appetite,

46:28.790 --> 46:31.720
so I wanted to make something that tastes different.

46:32.690 --> 46:33.720
I meant well.

46:34.350 --> 46:35.610
You misunderstood me.

46:39.590 --> 46:40.590
We fought before.

46:41.430 --> 46:42.860
The internal skill you cultivated

46:42.860 --> 46:43.930
is extremely yin.

46:44.900 --> 46:46.060
Eating yin things

46:46.060 --> 46:47.190
will be fine for you.

46:48.370 --> 46:49.780
But what I have cultivated

46:49.780 --> 46:51.080
is extremely yang.

46:51.670 --> 46:52.800
It clashes with yin.

46:53.520 --> 46:56.370
Besides, I've already suffered internal injuries.

46:56.370 --> 46:57.910
So you can eat it.

46:58.810 --> 46:59.540
While it will

47:00.370 --> 47:01.460
damage my health.

47:01.860 --> 47:02.660
Guardian Jin,

47:04.130 --> 47:05.490
I don't know you well.

47:06.230 --> 47:07.260
How would I know

47:07.260 --> 47:09.260
what internal skill you cultivate?

47:10.220 --> 47:11.220
We fought before.

47:11.670 --> 47:12.870
Of course you'd know.

47:14.460 --> 47:15.260
Guardian Jin,

47:15.950 --> 47:18.310
I've always respected you for your righteousness.

47:18.310 --> 47:20.110
I've always been nice to you too.

47:21.160 --> 47:24.610
But if you are going to be slandering me here and asking questions you know the answers to,

47:24.610 --> 47:25.870
I'll just be frank too.

47:27.030 --> 47:28.030
You know very well

47:28.460 --> 47:30.160
if you used your internal skill

47:30.160 --> 47:31.490
when you fought with me.

47:32.380 --> 47:34.190
I thought you were going easy on me

47:34.190 --> 47:36.320
because you didn't want me to get hurt.

47:36.610 --> 47:38.180
That's why you only use your skills

47:38.180 --> 47:39.780
and not your internal skill.

47:40.160 --> 47:42.020
I even told the Sword Wielder that

47:42.030 --> 47:43.960
you deliberately let me win the bet

47:44.050 --> 47:46.580
so that I can go to the back hill to protect him.

47:47.720 --> 47:49.440
But why are you trying to

47:50.580 --> 47:51.900
set me up for now?

47:52.620 --> 47:53.860
You're eloquent.

47:54.510 --> 47:55.470
You win.

47:55.490 --> 47:58.520
You said the internal skill I practiced is extremely yin.

47:58.520 --> 47:59.130
Fine.

47:59.780 --> 48:02.430
The Snowmelt Heart Sutra that the Sword Wielder practices

48:02.430 --> 48:04.490
is an extremely yang internal skill.

48:04.820 --> 48:06.740
Why don't we ask him

48:06.740 --> 48:07.640
when he's back

48:08.500 --> 48:09.890
if he's okay

48:10.980 --> 48:12.440
after eating my desserts?

48:16.800 --> 48:18.290
It's so hard.

48:21.740 --> 48:22.280
Morning.

48:26.420 --> 48:27.470
There are so many

48:27.870 --> 48:29.870
interesting things in Xue Lineage.

48:30.580 --> 48:33.310
The snow lotus is very precious in the front hill.

48:33.330 --> 48:35.540
Even the clinic often runs out of it all the time.

48:35.540 --> 48:36.510
Can I have a few?

48:36.670 --> 48:37.090
No.

48:39.300 --> 48:39.990
So stingy.

48:41.300 --> 48:44.050
I'm not asking you for the best snow lotus in the Ice Pool.

48:44.050 --> 48:46.880
You're not giving me even the ordinary snow lotus in this lake

48:46.880 --> 48:48.480
and even ate all my desserts.

48:48.540 --> 48:50.140
Desserts can be made easily.

48:50.940 --> 48:51.800
This snow lotus

48:52.870 --> 48:54.620
take years for it to bloom.

48:54.640 --> 48:56.700
Who says desserts can be made easily?

48:57.220 --> 48:59.410
They are the desserts from Yun's hometown that she made personally.

48:59.410 --> 49:00.940
You can’t buy it with money.

49:01.740 --> 49:04.090
You've passed the first trial.

49:05.100 --> 49:07.630
Can you act a little more like a Sword Wielder?

49:11.260 --> 49:14.720
We're going to teach you the swordsmanship of the Xue Lineage.

49:15.880 --> 49:17.410
[Three Forms of Snow Saber]

49:18.710 --> 49:20.370
I thought you were lying to me.

49:20.610 --> 49:22.670
So there really is a saber scripture.

49:23.820 --> 49:25.350
Give me the medical record.

49:27.450 --> 49:29.050
Gong Ziyu treats you so well.

49:29.160 --> 49:30.690
We treat you as our own too.

49:31.340 --> 49:34.070
How dare you conspire with outsiders to cheat us?

49:34.240 --> 49:35.650
Don't you feel guilty?

49:36.930 --> 49:39.510
I knew you were not simple when you attempted to

49:39.510 --> 49:41.680
approach the Sword Wielder time after time.

49:41.680 --> 49:42.980
But I just thought you were

49:42.980 --> 49:44.810
a bride who was sent into the Gong family

49:44.810 --> 49:46.870
trying to climb up the social ladder.

49:47.180 --> 49:48.650
Since you entered the Yu Lineage,

49:48.650 --> 49:49.910
we are on the same boat.

49:50.500 --> 49:52.310
As long as you're good to the Sword Wielder,

49:52.310 --> 49:54.310
even if you have an ulterior motive,

49:54.470 --> 49:56.000
I won't hold it against you.

49:56.580 --> 49:59.110
But I didn't expect that I was wrong about you.

49:59.370 --> 50:00.970
You're just on the same boat,

50:00.970 --> 50:02.810
but can't go through the hardships,

50:02.810 --> 50:04.470
and only side with the strong.

50:05.920 --> 50:06.770
But Miss Yun,

50:07.600 --> 50:09.930
don't you think it's too hasty to jump ship

50:10.590 --> 50:12.390
before you even see the end line?

50:16.770 --> 50:19.370
I don't understand what you're talking about.

50:24.960 --> 50:27.190
Since you aren't going to defend yourself,

50:27.190 --> 50:29.520
then we don't need to waste our breath too.

50:30.300 --> 50:31.280
Let's decide everything

50:31.280 --> 50:33.010
when the Sword Wielder is back.

50:48.720 --> 50:50.150
Before the Sword Wielder is back,

50:50.150 --> 50:51.540
no one is allowed to come near

50:51.540 --> 50:53.270
nor anyone is allowed to leave.

50:53.910 --> 50:54.410
Yes.

51:11.710 --> 51:13.930
Gong Ziyu has passed the Ice Pool trial.

51:15.110 --> 51:17.040
The Xue Lineage approved him of his

51:17.340 --> 51:18.470
determination,

51:18.930 --> 51:19.710
focus,

51:20.220 --> 51:20.850
strength,

51:21.200 --> 51:22.130
and strong will.

51:22.610 --> 51:25.670
Now, we will be passing on the Three Forms of Snow Saber,

51:26.120 --> 51:26.830
New Snow,

51:27.420 --> 51:28.030
Air Frost,

51:28.580 --> 51:29.380
and Cold Wave,

51:29.980 --> 51:31.270
to Gong Ziyu...

51:31.900 --> 51:34.100
We hope Gong Ziyu can practice them hard

51:34.820 --> 51:36.680
with the ancestors witnessing it

51:36.770 --> 51:38.030
to protect the valley.

51:39.210 --> 51:40.910
Although there are only three forms,

51:40.910 --> 51:42.440
they are very complicated.

51:42.610 --> 51:43.750
Whether you can master it

51:43.750 --> 51:45.480
depends on your intelligence.

51:46.100 --> 51:47.490
How long will it take?

51:48.660 --> 51:49.380
Not too bad.

51:52.020 --> 51:54.280
I've been learning them for seven years.

51:54.740 --> 51:55.600
Seven years?

51:56.460 --> 51:58.060
You were born afraid of cold,

51:58.620 --> 51:59.800
but because of that,

52:00.370 --> 52:03.310
your eight meridians are different from ordinary people.

52:03.310 --> 52:04.590
It's perfect for

52:04.630 --> 52:05.890
Snowmelt Heart Sutra.

52:08.500 --> 52:10.980
If you can learn the Three Forms of Snow Saber,

52:10.980 --> 52:13.330
you won't be the Sword Wielder just by title,

52:13.330 --> 52:15.330
but without capabilities anymore.

52:17.700 --> 52:18.870
Am I that strong?

52:24.380 --> 52:24.910
Oh right.

52:25.960 --> 52:28.140
My brother Gong Huanyu and Gong Shangjue

52:28.140 --> 52:30.470
also passed the test of the Ice Lotus Pool.

52:31.610 --> 52:32.530
You said

52:33.120 --> 52:35.730
its a test of either persistence or capabilities.

52:35.730 --> 52:36.730
May I ask

52:37.470 --> 52:38.860
how did Gong Shangjue

52:39.130 --> 52:40.140
pass this test?

52:41.750 --> 52:43.080
He has both persistence

52:43.480 --> 52:44.540
and capabilities.

52:45.260 --> 52:46.520
It's only natural that

52:47.550 --> 52:48.680
he passed this test.

52:50.200 --> 52:51.800
He dived to the end of the pool

52:51.920 --> 52:53.180
with his persistence.

52:54.590 --> 52:56.210
At the same time, with his strong internal skill,

52:56.210 --> 52:58.470
he controlled his breathing perfectly.

52:59.820 --> 53:00.940
After he got the iron box

53:00.940 --> 53:02.560
and emerged from the surface of the pool,

53:02.560 --> 53:04.220
he was still extremely sober,

53:04.510 --> 53:07.310
and sustained just some superficial frostbites.

53:08.860 --> 53:09.640
Did you

53:10.060 --> 53:12.260
teach him the Three Forms of Snow Saber?

53:12.330 --> 53:13.260
Did he master it?

53:13.960 --> 53:15.020
We won't know that.

53:17.740 --> 53:18.730
I must learn it

53:19.340 --> 53:20.400
and pay him a visit.

53:22.370 --> 53:23.310
I didn't expect

53:23.980 --> 53:25.060
the crybaby

53:25.350 --> 53:26.950
has become the Sword Wielder

53:27.890 --> 53:30.540
and took on the responsibility of the Gong family.

53:30.540 --> 53:31.720
You flatter me.

53:36.130 --> 53:38.190
After leaving the back hill that day,

53:38.500 --> 53:39.890
Elder Xue took me home.

53:41.360 --> 53:43.360
Father locked me up for three months

53:44.150 --> 53:46.150
and forced me to practice every day.

53:47.220 --> 53:49.300
He had high hopes for you.

53:52.010 --> 53:52.710
Yes.

53:54.010 --> 53:55.100
I understand now.

53:58.000 --> 53:58.930
Unfortunately,

54:01.320 --> 54:02.720
I only understood it now.

54:09.930 --> 54:11.260
Have you ever blamed me?

54:11.780 --> 54:12.870
I never came to look for you

54:12.870 --> 54:14.220
since then.

54:16.050 --> 54:17.180
I promised

54:17.350 --> 54:18.550
to take you to the sea,

54:18.950 --> 54:19.950
to view lanterns,

54:20.350 --> 54:21.430
and see the desert.

54:23.150 --> 54:24.390
You were still young.

54:25.590 --> 54:27.590
I didn't take your words seriously.

54:28.820 --> 54:29.930
But I was serious.

54:31.870 --> 54:34.260
When I secure my position as the Sword Wielder

54:34.260 --> 54:35.990
and the Gong family is at peace,

54:36.590 --> 54:38.320
I'll take you out to have a look.

54:39.520 --> 54:41.120
It's so cold at the back hill.

54:42.100 --> 54:44.560
You've been guarding here for so many years.

54:45.040 --> 54:46.370
It must've been lonely.

54:52.310 --> 54:54.440
Since I'm the guard of the Xue Lineage,

54:55.310 --> 54:57.640
the hustle and bustle of the outside world

54:57.790 --> 54:59.430
has nothing to do with me.

55:03.090 --> 55:04.750
Same goes for the Sword Wielder.

55:04.750 --> 55:07.310
Since you've taken on the task to guard the Gong family

55:07.310 --> 55:09.440
and shoulder the burden of the valley,

55:09.900 --> 55:12.100
you should also have a proper attitude.

55:12.960 --> 55:14.370
The promise you made with me

55:14.370 --> 55:16.410
is just a passing remark made by a child.

55:16.410 --> 55:18.910
But the promise that the Sword Wielder makes to the Gong family

55:18.910 --> 55:20.150
can never be changed

55:20.690 --> 55:21.890
and never taken back.

55:23.890 --> 55:25.740
You may have strong emotional attachments

55:25.740 --> 55:26.800
to the Gong family,

55:29.560 --> 55:30.590
but I'm but a nobody

55:30.590 --> 55:32.990
who has been looked down since I was a child.

55:34.810 --> 55:36.310
I've seen the women of the Gong family

55:36.310 --> 55:38.110
be trapped for their whole life.

55:40.550 --> 55:42.990
Although they may think they are happy,

55:45.470 --> 55:47.070
they are still birds in cages

55:48.620 --> 55:49.900
and fishes in the pond.

55:52.020 --> 55:54.020
I've seen the men of the Gong family,

55:54.980 --> 55:57.980
though they have the ability to fight against Wufeng,

55:58.660 --> 56:01.520
they only know how to cower in this corner of a valley

56:02.040 --> 56:04.040
and care only about their own peace,

56:05.550 --> 56:08.150
indifferent to the chaos in the outside world.

56:12.130 --> 56:12.760
So...

56:15.470 --> 56:17.130
I don't actually have a strong

56:18.220 --> 56:20.550
emotional attachment to the Gong family.

56:21.830 --> 56:23.930
You are no longer a 9-year-old child,

56:25.170 --> 56:28.170
but you are still saying nothing but immature things.

56:29.800 --> 56:31.730
Wufeng is strong and complicated.

56:32.090 --> 56:33.260
It's not something

56:33.540 --> 56:35.070
that can be shaken up easily

56:35.070 --> 56:37.330
with just a spurt of rashness or passion.

56:38.560 --> 56:40.490
Although the martial world is big,

56:41.770 --> 56:42.780
isn't this valley

56:44.530 --> 56:46.260
also part of the martial world?

56:47.550 --> 56:48.950
By guarding this corner,

56:50.390 --> 56:51.790
we are also protecting

56:51.790 --> 56:54.520
a glimmer of light and hope for the martial world.

57:00.030 --> 57:02.230
You're overlooking what's important.

57:02.380 --> 57:03.730
You see a dead leaf

57:04.210 --> 57:06.270
and think the whole tree is withered.

57:06.690 --> 57:08.020
This is narrow-minded.

57:09.320 --> 57:13.250
You have had your prejudice against the Gong family since you were a child.

57:13.250 --> 57:14.210
This prejudice

57:15.620 --> 57:17.700
is this dead leaf to you.

57:19.150 --> 57:20.470
Sword Wielder, you must've not

57:20.470 --> 57:23.330
tried to learn more about the Gong family, have you?

57:25.560 --> 57:27.420
Learn more about the Gong family?

57:31.270 --> 57:32.050
Did you just

57:32.930 --> 57:34.390
call me the Sword Wielder?

57:36.860 --> 57:37.550
I told you.

57:38.730 --> 57:39.930
If you pass the trial,

57:41.440 --> 57:43.370
you will be the Sword Wielder to me.

57:47.390 --> 57:47.950
But

57:48.370 --> 57:50.030
I just passed the first trial.

57:50.220 --> 57:52.280
There are two more trials ahead of me.

57:52.950 --> 57:54.680
They have nothing to do with me.

57:54.680 --> 57:55.600
In my heart,

57:56.210 --> 57:58.670
you are worthy of the title "Sword Wielder."

58:02.700 --> 58:03.560
What about you?

58:03.650 --> 58:04.820
He acknowledged you.

58:04.820 --> 58:06.020
Of course I would too.

58:06.250 --> 58:07.380
What's there to ask?

58:11.510 --> 58:13.110
I've always wanted to ask...

58:13.520 --> 58:14.570
who among you two

58:15.710 --> 58:17.770
is the guardian of the Snow Hill?

58:18.190 --> 58:19.130
Me, of course.

58:20.940 --> 58:23.140
It took you so long to ask this question.

58:23.940 --> 58:25.670
You're bad at reading the room.

58:27.790 --> 58:28.500
The person

58:29.910 --> 58:31.990
you promised to take and see the outside world,

58:31.990 --> 58:32.770
to the sea,

58:33.250 --> 58:34.250
to view lanterns,

58:35.120 --> 58:36.850
and see the desert, was also me.

58:39.890 --> 58:40.410
Heh.

58:41.570 --> 58:42.770
Men can't be trusted.

58:47.850 --> 58:50.020
I'm just a servant who grew up with him.

58:50.860 --> 58:51.990
Why else do you think

58:52.100 --> 58:53.500
it took me seven years to learn

58:53.500 --> 58:55.160
the Three Forms of Snow Saber?

58:55.540 --> 58:56.140
What about

58:56.380 --> 58:56.910
him then?

58:57.540 --> 58:59.050
How long did he take to learn it?

58:59.050 --> 58:59.710
Four years.

59:00.750 --> 59:01.780
Four years?

59:02.580 --> 59:03.910
That's not fast either.

59:04.240 --> 59:05.920
I thought he was gifted.

59:06.930 --> 59:07.990
He spent four years

59:08.400 --> 59:10.460
to create these three forms

59:11.300 --> 59:13.380
to replace the old Snow Saber forms.

59:14.070 --> 59:14.770
Gong Ziyu.

59:15.520 --> 59:17.180
You're now the Sword Wielder,

59:18.060 --> 59:19.260
don't let your father

59:19.260 --> 59:20.880
down.

59:27.540 --> 59:28.400
My father

59:29.600 --> 59:31.380
didn't have high hopes for me.

59:33.190 --> 59:35.520
He put all his expectations on my brother.

59:36.700 --> 59:38.160
I became the Sword Wielder

59:38.650 --> 59:41.780
only because of the sudden situation in the Gong family.

59:43.360 --> 59:44.160
You're wrong.

59:45.730 --> 59:47.860
Your father has devoted himself to you

59:48.420 --> 59:49.480
and had high hopes.

59:50.460 --> 59:51.590
Jin Fan is the proof.

59:53.490 --> 59:54.140
Jin Fan?

59:55.380 --> 59:56.780
Didn't you find it weird?

59:56.930 --> 59:57.990
In the Gong family,

59:58.510 --> 59:59.840
only the Sword Wielder,

59:59.870 --> 01:00:00.930
the Lineage Heads,

01:00:01.110 --> 01:00:01.770
the Elders,

01:00:02.100 --> 01:00:03.300
as well as the Young Lord in succession

01:00:03.300 --> 01:00:04.310
are qualified to

01:00:04.330 --> 01:00:06.060
have a personal Jade Guardian.

01:00:07.020 --> 01:00:08.550
What was your status before

01:00:09.140 --> 01:00:10.340
that could have allowed Jin Fan

01:00:10.340 --> 01:00:12.740
to follow you around since you were a child?

01:00:13.510 --> 01:00:15.110
Maybe it's because my father

01:00:15.550 --> 01:00:17.500
wanted to arrange a Green Jade Guardian by my side

01:00:17.500 --> 01:00:18.560
to keep an eye on me.

01:00:18.850 --> 01:00:21.830
He's afraid that I will bring him troubles outside of the Gong family.

01:00:21.830 --> 01:00:24.410
Do you really think an ordinary Green Jade Guardian

01:00:24.410 --> 01:00:26.070
can know the content of the Trial of the Three Realms

01:00:26.070 --> 01:00:26.930
to this detail?

01:00:27.330 --> 01:00:28.570
What do you mean?

01:00:30.020 --> 01:00:32.710
Those who are in the front hill are all Green Jade Guards.

01:00:32.710 --> 01:00:33.450
Those in the Council of Elders

01:00:33.450 --> 01:00:34.460
and the guards in the back hill

01:00:34.460 --> 01:00:36.190
are the Yellow Jade Guardians.

01:00:36.810 --> 01:00:38.260
Back then, the former Sword Wielder,

01:00:38.260 --> 01:00:40.720
withstanding the pressure from the elders,

01:00:40.780 --> 01:00:42.310
took great pains to get them to agree to

01:00:42.310 --> 01:00:44.640
transferring to Jin Fan to be by your side.

01:00:45.550 --> 01:00:47.950
The former Sword Guardian took your safety

01:00:49.140 --> 01:00:51.470
as seriously as he did with the whole Gong family

01:00:51.470 --> 01:00:53.390
and even the whole valley.

01:00:58.130 --> 01:00:58.950
Jin Fan...

01:00:59.900 --> 01:01:01.760
is really a Yellow Jade Guardian?

01:01:02.210 --> 01:01:02.840
No.

01:01:04.860 --> 01:01:06.330
He's a Red Jade Guardian.

01:01:08.810 --> 01:01:10.090
He is the youngest ever

01:01:11.350 --> 01:01:13.810
Red Jade Guardian in Gong family's history.

01:01:20.220 --> 01:01:22.280
Are there really Red Jade Guardians?

01:01:23.490 --> 01:01:25.380
I think the elders lied to us.

01:01:25.850 --> 01:01:27.190
Red Jade Guardians,

01:01:27.630 --> 01:01:29.920
to me, are just like Nuwa and Fuxi,

01:01:29.940 --> 01:01:31.230
they are just legends.

01:02:21.920 --> 01:02:23.320
Your father asked Jin Fan

01:02:23.650 --> 01:02:24.650
to give up his position of

01:02:24.650 --> 01:02:26.120
the Red Jade Guardian he achieved painstakingly

01:02:26.120 --> 01:02:27.390
through the trials

01:02:28.140 --> 01:02:30.790
to be demoted to the lowest-level Green Jade Guardian

01:02:30.790 --> 01:02:32.720
to serve you since you were a child.

01:02:33.140 --> 01:02:34.340
Can't this prove

01:02:34.740 --> 01:02:36.670
your father had high hopes for you?

01:02:38.820 --> 01:02:39.300
Come!

01:02:39.490 --> 01:02:40.690
Let's play together!

01:02:56.760 --> 01:02:57.540
Guardian Jin.

01:02:57.540 --> 01:02:59.050
You've been guarding for a whole day.

01:02:59.050 --> 01:03:00.250
Would you like to eat?

01:03:05.140 --> 01:03:05.620
No.

01:03:12.140 --> 01:03:14.540
In order to match your top-class guardian,

01:03:15.390 --> 01:03:15.990
Gong Ziyu,

01:03:16.930 --> 01:03:18.990
you need to be a top-class Sword Wielder too.
